    <statement><p>A constant force <m>{\mathbf F} = 2 {\mathbf i} + 7 {\mathbf j} + 7 {\mathbf k}</m> moves an object
along a straight line from point <m>(5, -2, -4)</m> to point <m>(2, -8, 11)</m>.</p>
<p>Find the work done if the distance is measured in meters and the magnitude of the force
is measured in newtons.</p>
<p>Work: <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/> Nm</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>57</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
